Z||000016||jlruiz67||08-25-2000||12:22 AM||||Blade:<BR>I'm not in a car club I'm to far from San Diego and from Riverside and those are the clubs arrownd us. I could not own a Fiero if it was not for this forum ( it has saved me a small fortune and safety tips) If you find a closer club please let me know.  I'm in Laguna Niguel||||reg||1
