Z||000022||GT Bastard||08-25-2000||01:06 PM||||Hell yeah, it sounds like a monster.  Really super throaty. My old '94 Z28 didn't sound this mean with it's Flomaster muffler.  Pretty quiet at idle, but it come alive when you give it a little gas. ||||reg||14
